  "输入特征 H": "Input features H",
  "H 表示本模块接收的 4 个特征。将 H 乘上 4 × 2 权重矩阵，每个输出由 4 项乘积求和，得到 2 维结果 F；输入不一定来自门控。": "H denotes the four input features received by this module. Multiply H by the 4 × 2 weight matrix: each output sums four products to produce the two-dimensional result F. The input need not come from gating.",
  "模块“{module}”的输入端口 {port} 未连接。请将一个输出端口连接到这里。": "Input port {port} on module \"{module}\" is not connected. Connect an output port to it.",
