  "模拟第二轮首词时间 ≤ 60 ms，内存 ≤ 24 GB，最大数值误差 ≤ 0.30": "Simulated second-turn first token ≤ 60 ms; memory ≤ 24 GB; maximum numeric error ≤ 0.30",
  "计算模块": "Compute module",
  "将一个 token 的各个特征平方并求平均，加上 ε 后开平方，得到尺度 r。各特征都除以这个 r；其他 token 分别计算自己的 r。": "Square one token’s features and take their mean, add ε, then take the square root to obtain r. Divide every feature by that r; each other token computes its own r.",
  "将四个特征投影为两个": "Project four features into two",
  "连接线性投影与降维投影。出口应得到由四个投影特征组合成的两个数，本关不加入激活。": "Connect the linear projection and down projection. The outlet should contain two values combined from four projected features, without an activation in this lesson.",
  "组合单支路 SiLU FFN": "Assemble a single-branch SiLU FFN",
  "输出单支路 SiLU FFN 的 2 维结果 F": "Output the two-dimensional result F of a single-branch SiLU FFN",
  "组合已学的投影、SiLU 和降维模块。出口应得到 2 维 FFN 结果，暂不加残差。": "Combine the familiar projection, SiLU and down-projection modules. Produce a two-dimensional FFN result at the outlet, without residual addition yet.",
  "用门投影计算特征 G": "Compute features G with gate projection",
