  "连接门投影，用 Wg 将输入从 2 维展开到 4 维。本关只输出 G，不加入 SiLU 或逐元素相乘。": "Connect the gate projection and use Wg to expand the input from two to four dimensions. Output only G, without SiLU or elementwise multiplication.",
  "逐项相乘两组投影结果": "Multiply projected vectors elementwise",
  "两块投影已连接输入。补上逐元素相乘，让出口得到四个对应位置的乘积；本关不加入 SiLU。": "Both projections already receive the input. Add elementwise multiplication to produce four matching-entry products at the outlet, without SiLU in this lesson.",
  "完成 SwiGLU 的降维投影": "Complete the SwiGLU down projection",
  "输出降回 2 维的 SwiGLU 结果 F": "Output the SwiGLU result F projected back to two dimensions",
  "双路门控已连接好。补上降维投影，让出口得到 2 维 FFN 结果 F，暂不加残差。": "The two-branch gate is connected. Add the down projection to produce the two-dimensional FFN result F at the outlet, without residual addition yet.",
  "按位置旋转查询 Q": "Rotate queries Q by position",
  "输出各位置按指定角度旋转后的 Q": "Output Q rotated by the specified angle at each position",
  "Q 投影已连接好。补上位置旋转，让三个位置分别转过 0、1、2 弧度；本关只处理 Q，不计算匹配分数。": "The Q projection is connected. Add positional rotation by 0, 1 and 2 radians at the three positions. Process only Q; this lesson does not compute matching scores.",
  "按注意力权重汇合 V": "Aggregate V with attention weights",
  "输出各查询位置对 V 的加权和 O": "Output the weighted sum O of V at each query position",
  "注意力权重与 V 投影已连接输入。补上加权汇合，让出口得到每个位置的两个特征，暂不做输出投影。": "The attention-weight module and V projection already receive the input. Add weighted aggregation to produce two features per position at the outlet, without output projection yet.",
  "相同的三个分数会得到各约 1/3；其中一个更高，它分到的比例就更大。本关只计算比例，不限制可见位置；因果遮罩才负责排除未来位置。": "Three equal scores each receive about 1/3; a higher score receives a larger share. This lesson computes proportions without restricting visibility. A causal mask excludes future positions.",
  "旋转保留向量长度，并可改变方向。例如 [1, 0] 转过 90° 会成为 [0, 1]。按位置使用不同角度，让相同特征可以带上位置差异。": "Rotation preserves vector length and can change direction. For example, [1, 0] rotated by 90° becomes [0, 1]. Position-dependent angles can distinguish otherwise identical features.",
  "用两块熟悉的投影算出修改量 F，再用残差相加得到 X + F。桌上的模块都还没有接线，五组输入都要匹配。": "Use the two familiar projections to compute update F, then use residual addition to produce X + F. All modules start disconnected; match all five inputs.",
  "将 SiLU 用于门分支，再用逐项乘积调节内容特征。": "Apply SiLU to the gate branch, then scale content features with elementwise products.",
  "在已连接的两路投影上加入 SiLU 门控。出口应得到门值与内容的逐项乘积，五组输入都要匹配目标。": "Add SiLU gating to the connected projection branches. Produce the elementwise product of gate values and content at the outlet, matching all five inputs.",
  "连接 RMSNorm，让三个位置各自按均方根缩放。维度和位置顺序不变；本关缩放权重为 1。": "Connect RMSNorm to scale each of the three positions by its own RMS. Keep dimensions and position order unchanged; the scale weights are 1 here.",
  "用线性投影计算内容特征 U": "Compute content features U with a linear projection",
  "“内容”描述它在这条支路的用途，运算仍是线性投影。门分支经 SiLU 得到系数 S，再与 U 逐项相乘；同一个内容值可被缩小、放大或改变符号，取决于当前输入产生的系数。": "Content describes this branch’s role; the operation is still a linear projection. The gate branch applies SiLU to produce factors S, then multiplies them by U elementwise. The same content value may shrink, grow or change sign, depending on the input-dependent factor.",
  "[1, 0] 和 [0, 1] 是不同的特征向量。传递时保留数值和顺序，后面的权重才能作用到对应的特征上。": "[1, 0] and [0, 1] are different feature vectors. Preserving values and order lets later weights act on the intended features.",
  "为什么要自行放置模块？": "Why place modules yourself?",
  "相隔一格和两格，旋转角度差不同，匹配分数可能不同，但不保证每次变化。Q/K 的位置同时平移时，相对角度不变。本关用一对特征演示；真实 RoPE 在多对特征上使用不同频率。": "Positions one and two steps apart have different rotation offsets, so their scores may differ, but a change is not guaranteed. Shifting Q and K equally preserves their relative angle. This lesson uses one feature pair; real RoPE uses different frequencies across many pairs.",
  "多轮提示常有相同的开头。开启 KV 缓存后，模型、token 前缀和位置都匹配时，可以复用已有的前缀 K/V，省去新一轮对应部分的 Prefill。": "Prompts across turns often share a beginning. With KV caching enabled, matching model, token prefix and positions allow reuse of prefix K/V, avoiding that part of Prefill in the new turn.",
  "从组件架放置投影模块": "Place a projection from the module shelf",
  "放置投影模块并连接输入与出口": "Place a projection module and connect the input and outlet",
  "从组件架拖入投影模块，连接输入与出口，再运行网络。": "Drag a projection from the module shelf, connect the input and outlet, then run the network.",
