  "练习连接端口和运行网络，原样传递向量。": "Practice connecting ports and running the network to pass a vector through unchanged.",
  "圆形端口输出数据，方形端口接收数据。先点圆形端口，再点方形端口；也可以拖动连线。": "Round ports send data; square ports receive it. Click a round port, then a square port, or drag a wire between them.",
  "用权重展开特征": "Expand features with weights",
  "连接线性投影，让出口得到 4 维投影结果。三组输入共用同一套权重，都要匹配目标。": "Connect the linear projection to produce a four-dimensional result at the outlet. All three inputs use the same weights and must match their targets.",
  "用同一套权重将每个 2 维输入投影为 4 维结果。": "Project each two-dimensional input into four dimensions using the same weights.",
  "对投影结果应用 SiLU": "Apply SiLU to projected features",
  "输出投影结果经 SiLU 计算后的 4 维向量": "Output the four-dimensional vector after applying SiLU to the projection",
  "连接投影与 SiLU，得到激活结果 S。向量保持 4 维，三组输入都要匹配目标。": "Connect the projection and SiLU to produce activations S. Keep four dimensions and match the targets for all three inputs.",
  "对投影结果逐项应用 SiLU，比较激活前后的数值。": "Apply SiLU to each projected value and compare the values before and after activation.",
  "运行网络后，比较出口的实际值与目标值。维度相同不代表数值正确。": "Run the network and compare actual and target values at the outlet. Matching dimensions do not guarantee matching values.",
  "SiLU 对每个数单独计算，不改变向量维度。双击模块可查看公式和示例。": "SiLU processes each value independently without changing the vector dimensions. Double-click the module to inspect its formula and example.",
  "用 SiLU 门值调节内容": "Scale content with SiLU gate values",
  "输出 SiLU 门值与内容特征的逐项乘积 H": "Output H, the elementwise product of SiLU gate values and content features",
  "内容分支计算 U，门分支经 SiLU 计算系数 S。系数依赖当前输入；逐项相乘后，同一个内容值可以得到不同结果，而两套权重保持不变。": "The content branch computes U; the gate branch uses SiLU to compute factors S. These factors depend on the input, so elementwise multiplication can give different results for the same content value while both weight matrices stay fixed.",
  "将 SiLU 加入双路投影，得到门控特征。": "Add SiLU to the two-branch projection to produce gated features.",
  "一个圆形输出端口可以连接多条连线；每条连线传递同一份向量，不会消耗原值。": "A round output port can connect to several wires. Each wire carries the same vector without consuming the original values.",
  "圆形端口是输出，方形端口是输入；同一个输出端口可连接多个模块。": "Round ports are outputs; square ports are inputs. One output port can connect to several modules.",
