  "正在运行：{input}": "Running: {input}",
  "输入 {input} 未通过验证。请查看运行报告。": "Input {input} failed validation. Check the run report.",
  "全部 {count} 组输入验证通过。": "All {count} input cases passed validation.",
  "<span>▶</span> 运行": "<span>▶</span> Run",
  "查看提示": "View hint",
  "关于游戏": "About the game",
  "运行": "Run",
  "正在加载工作台…": "Loading the workbench…",
  "返回工作台": "Return to workbench",
  "返回工作台会保留模块和连线，并清除本次运行结果。调整后可再次运行。": "Return to the workbench to keep your modules and wires and clear this run’s results. Make changes, then run again.",
  "“仅清除通关标记”保留接线。“全部重新开始”将所有关卡恢复到初始状态。": "Clear completion badges only keeps your wiring. Start over in all levels restores every level to its initial state.",
  "清除所有关卡的通关标记和完成计数？模块、连线和设置会保留。此操作无法撤销。": "Clear completion badges and counts for all levels? Modules, wires and settings will remain. You cannot undo this action.",
  "将所有关卡恢复到初始状态并清除通关标记？预设模块会保留，自行添加的模块和连线会重置。语言、音乐和速度不变。可用“撤销上次全部重置”恢复重置前的进度。": "Restore all levels to their initial state and clear completion badges? Preset modules remain. Modules and wires you added are reset. Language, music and speed stay unchanged. Use Undo the last full reset to restore the previous progress.",
  "浏览器无法播放背景音乐。你仍可继续游戏。": "The browser cannot play background music. You can continue playing.",
  "开启或关闭游戏背景音乐。": "Turn game music on or off.",
  "连接模块，观察神经网络如何计算。": "Connect modules and see how a neural network computes.",
  "按主题选择": "Choose a topic",
  "从基础运算逐步搭建完整网络。每关的接线和进度单独保存。": "Build a complete network from basic operations. Each level saves its wiring and progress separately.",
  "游戏说明": "Game guide",
  "通过接线学习神经网络": "Learn neural networks by connecting modules",
  "连接模块，观察数值如何经过神经网络。再选择云端或端侧路线，练习数据搬运、内存管理和计算调度。": "Connect modules and observe how values pass through a neural network. Then use the cloud or on-device track to practice data transfers, memory management and compute scheduling.",
  "原版结构使用固定手工权重演示小规模推理。基础算子使用两个特征；完整层使用四个特征、两个注意力头。编码器和解码器各一层。LayerNorm 的缩放为 1、偏移为 0，FFN 偏置为 0。不包含训练或翻译能力。生成循环关使用固定转移表解释控制流程。": "The original structure demonstrates small-scale inference with fixed teaching weights. Basic operators use two features. Full layers use four features and two attention heads. There is one encoder layer and one decoder layer. LayerNorm scale is 1 and shift is 0. FFN biases are zero. The model cannot train or translate. The generation-loop lesson uses a fixed transition table to explain control flow.",
  "模型内部的特征对应输入位置，不是新生成的词。词表投影计算分数，选词步骤再确定词编号。“注意力错误”表示计算与本关目标不符，不代表对真实模型语言理解的判断。": "Internal features belong to input positions. They are not newly generated tokens. Vocabulary projection computes scores; token selection then determines token IDs. An attention error means the calculation differs from the lesson target. It does not judge how a real model understands language.",
  "端侧路线的时间、内存用量和 ANE 工作占比来自教学成本模型，不是 Apple 硬件实测。游戏规定了 ANE 支持的运算。真实设备的支持范围还取决于设备、编译器、模型和算子实现。": "On-device timing, memory use and ANE work share come from a teaching cost model, not measurements on Apple hardware. The game defines which operations the ANE supports. Real support also depends on the device, compiler, model and operator implementation.",
  "基础关练习单个运算，综合关组合这些运算。每关使用多组输入验证最终输出。接线和通关进度分别保存，切换关卡不会清空接线。": "Basic levels teach individual operations. Combined levels connect those operations. Each level checks the final output with multiple inputs. Wiring and completion progress are saved separately. Switching levels does not clear the wiring.",
  "拖动模块调整位置 · 选中连线后点击删除连线 · 双击模块查看说明": "Drag modules to move them · select a wire, then click Delete wire · double-click a module for details",
  "拖动模块调整位置 · 双击模块查看说明 · 圆形端口输出，方形端口输入": "Drag modules to move them · double-click a module for details · round ports are outputs; square ports are inputs",
