  "一个圆形输出口可以连接多条线，不会消耗原来的向量。": "A round output port can feed several wires. Sending a vector does not consume it.",
  "相加的两份向量需要同样长度；一份是原输入，一份是刚算出的变化。": "The vectors being added must have equal length: one is the input, the other is its newly computed update.",
