  "每个位置的向量除以自己的均方根。本例缩放权重设为 1；维度与位置顺序不变。": "Divide each position's vector by its own root mean square. The scale weights are 1 in this example; dimensions and position order stay unchanged.",
  "Q · 查询投影": "Q · Query projection",
  "每个位置生成查询。相同的权重用于所有位置。": "Create a query at each position. Every position uses the same weights.",
  "K · 键投影": "K · Key projection",
  "每个位置生成供查询匹配的键。": "Create a key at each position for queries to match against.",
  "V · 内容投影": "V · Value projection",
  "每个位置生成被注意力加权汇合的内容。": "Create the content at each position that attention will combine.",
  "QKᵀ · 打分": "QKᵀ · Scores",
  "把每个 Q 与每个 K 点乘，再除以 √2，得到 3 × 3 分数。": "Dot each Q with each K, then divide by √2 to obtain a 3 × 3 score matrix.",
  "因果遮罩": "Causal mask",
  "未来位置设为 −∞；Softmax 后这些位置的权重为 0。": "Set future positions to −∞. Their weights become 0 after softmax.",
  "每个查询位置的分数转成和为 1 的非负权重。": "Turn each query's scores into nonnegative weights that sum to 1.",
  "RoPE · 旋转 Q": "RoPE · Rotate Q",
  "位置 p 的向量旋转 p 弧度。真实模型有多对特征和不同频率。": "Rotate the vector at position p by p radians. Real models use multiple feature pairs with different frequencies.",
  "RoPE · 旋转 K": "RoPE · Rotate K",
  "K 使用与 Q 相同的按位置旋转规则；V 保持原样。": "K follows the same position-based rotation rule as Q. V stays unchanged.",
  "AV · 汇合内容": "AV · Mix values",
  "每个查询位置用注意力权重对各位置的 V 加权求和，得到该位置的输出向量。": "At each query position, use attention weights to sum the V vectors into one output vector.",
  "输出投影 Wo": "Output projection Wo",
  "汇合结果再乘 Wo，映射回残差流的特征宽度。": "Multiply the mixed content by Wo to return to the residual stream's feature width.",
  "已完成的 Attention": "Complete Attention",
  "内部包括 Q/K/V、RoPE、因果注意力与输出投影。双击可查看。": "Contains Q/K/V projections, RoPE, causal attention and output projection. Double-click to inspect it.",
  "Attention 残差": "Attention residual",
  "把 Attention 的变化量逐项加到原输入。": "Add the Attention update to the original input, feature by feature.",
  "已完成的 FFN": "Complete FFN",
  "对每个位置独立执行归一化、双路投影、SiLU、门控与降维。输出变化量 F。": "Independently apply normalization, two projections, SiLU, gating and down projection at each position. Outputs the update F.",
  "FFN 残差": "FFN residual",
  "把 FFN 变化量加到 Attention 后的残差流。": "Add the FFN update to the residual stream after Attention.",
  "词表投影": "Vocabulary projection",
  "每个位置的特征乘词表权重，加偏置，得到六个候选词的分数。": "Multiply each position's features by vocabulary weights and add biases to score six candidate words.",
  "取最高分": "Pick the highest score",
  "演示采用贪心选择：每个位置选最高分的词表 ID。真实生成也可按概率采样。": "This demo uses greedy selection: choose the highest-scoring vocabulary ID at each position. Real generation can also sample from probabilities.",
  "反向投影": "Sign inversion",
  "把特征乘 −1。它是本关用于调试的干扰组件。": "Multiply the features by −1. This is a decoy component for debugging this level.",
  "下一词模型": "Next-word model",
  "教学小模型：每个词的下一词分布由固定转移表计算。": "A miniature teaching model: a fixed transition table gives the next-word distribution for each word.",
  "追加新词": "Append a word",
  "将最新预测追加到上下文末尾，保留最后三个位置。": "Append the latest prediction to the context and keep the last three positions.",
  "读取权重": "Load weights",
  "把权重从存储准备到统一内存，供后续计算重复读取。": "Move weights from storage into unified memory so later computations can reuse them.",
  "读取词向量。在这个引擎关卡中输入已映射为两维特征。": "Read token embeddings. This engine level starts with inputs already mapped to 2D features.",
  "QKV 投影": "QKV projection",
  "本关把三组投影作为一个调度任务，处理三个输入位置。": "Schedule all three projections as one task processing three input positions.",
  "按因果注意力汇合内容。解码时只为新位置计算 Q/K/V，旧 K/V 可缓存。": "Combine values with causal attention. During decoding, compute Q/K/V only for the new position; earlier K/V can be cached.",
  "对每个位置做两路投影、激活、门控和降维，再接回残差。": "Apply two projections, activation, gating and down projection at each position, then add a residual.",
  "词表与采样": "Vocabulary and sampling",
  "得到词表分数并取最高分；调度任务仍返回数值，结果区显示预测。": "Compute vocabulary scores and pick the highest. The task returns numeric features; the results panel displays predictions.",
