  "双击组件查看输入、输出与计算。试跑后，出口才会比较实际值与目标值。": "Double-click a component to inspect its inputs, outputs and calculation. Actual and target values are compared only at the output after a run.",
  "从词到向量": "From words to vectors",
  "让 ID 查到自己的向量": "Look up each ID's vector",
  "从六词小词表中取出对应向量。编号只是地址，不能把编号直接当成特征。": "Find the matching vectors in a six-word vocabulary. IDs are addresses, not features.",
