  "3 个 ID → 3 × 2": "3 IDs → 3 × 2",
  "先整理数值尺度": "First, tidy the numerical scale",
  "让每个向量的均方根接近 1": "Bring each vector's RMS close to 1",
  "向量维度不变，三个输入位置的数值尺度统一。这里的 RMSNorm 缩放权重为 1。": "Keep the dimensions while normalizing the scale at all three positions. RMSNorm's scale weights are 1 here.",
  "归一化特征 Z": "Normalized features Z",
  "同一份输入，三个角色": "One input, three roles",
  "把内容向量送到出口": "Send the value vectors to the output",
  "Q 用来发起查询，K 用来匹配，V 提供内容。本关目标是 V；三块权重各不相同。": "Q asks, K matches, and V supplies content. This level's target is V. All three weight matrices are different.",
  "内容 V": "Values V",
  "查询在找谁": "What is the query looking for?",
  "得到每个 Q 对每个 K 的分数": "Score every Q against every K",
  "将三个位置的 Q 分别与三个位置的 K 配对，算出九个相关分数。输入口顺序是 Q、K。": "Pair the Q vectors at three positions with the K vectors at three positions to compute nine scores. The input ports take Q first, then K.",
  "相关分数 S": "Match scores S",
  "不要偷看未来": "No peeking into the future",
  "让未来位置的注意力为零": "Give future positions zero attention",
  "一次处理整句时，第一个位置也不能读取后面的词。让每个位置只分配权重给自己和过去。": "Even when processing the whole sentence at once, the first position cannot read later words. Give each position access only to itself and its past.",
  "注意力权重 A": "Attention weights A",
  "让位置进入匹配": "Give matching a sense of position",
  "位置变了，匹配分数也要变": "Different positions, different scores",
  "在点积前给 Q 和 K 注入位置。每个位置的向量旋转自己的角度；不要旋转 V。本例每个位置增加 1 弧度。": "Add position information to Q and K before the dot products. Rotate each position by its own angle, leaving V alone. This example adds 1 radian per position.",
  "带位置的分数": "Position-aware scores",
  "把关注变成内容": "Turn attention into content",
  "完成一次因果 Attention": "Build causal Attention",
  "把前面的小计算连起来，用注意力权重混合 V，再经输出投影。权重表示信息来源比例，不等同于完整的语言理解。": "Connect the earlier calculations: mix V using attention weights, then apply the output projection. The weights describe where content comes from, not a complete account of language understanding.",
  "让一层接起来": "Connect a whole layer",
  "Attention 与 FFN 都要接回原路": "Give both Attention and FFN their residuals",
  "用已经完成的模块搭一层。Attention 先接收归一化输入，FFN 模块内部已含自己的归一化。两次残差要找对各自的原输入。": "Build a layer from completed modules. Attention receives normalized input; the FFN already includes its own normalization. Connect each residual to the correct original input.",
  "让特征真正变成词": "Turn features into words",
  "让词表分数读出「我爱猫」": "Make the vocabulary scores read “I love cats”",
  "这一关才把特征变成文字。词表投影为每个候选词算分，取最高分。改变特征会改变文字；词一样也不保证全部数值正确。": "This is where features become words. Score the vocabulary candidates and pick the highest. Wrong features can change the word; the same word does not guarantee correct numbers.",
  "预测 Token ID": "Predicted token IDs",
  "把刚生成的词送回来": "Feed the new word back",
  "让上下文前进一步": "Move the context one step forward",
  "小模型已为下一词算分。输出应是追加新词后的最后三个位置，而不是三个独立预测。连续试跑可以看见解码循环。": "The miniature model has scored the next words. Output the last three positions after appending the new word, rather than three independent predictions. Run repeatedly to see the decoding loop.",
  "更新后的上下文": "Updated context",
  "上下文 → 下一词 → 追加": "Context → Next word → Append",
  "输出特征 / 预测词": "Output features / Predicted words",
