  "结果正确，模拟首词 ≤ 110 ms": "Correct results; simulated first token ≤ 110 ms",
  "拖动组件上方的芯片标记，把任务放到 CPU、GPU 或 ANE 区域。不能只看峰值速度，还要看算子支持与交接。": "Drag the chip badges above modules onto CPU, GPU or ANE. Consider supported operators and handoff costs, not just peak compute speed.",
  "让 ANE 读懂布局": "Give ANE the right layout",
  "编译成功，模拟首词 ≤ 110 ms": "Compile successfully; simulated first token ≤ 110 ms",
  "ANE 上的投影采用通道在前的四维布局。形状相同不等于内存排列相同；布局不兼容会回退或无法编译。": "ANE projections here use four-dimensional, channel-first tensors. Equal shapes can have different memory layouts. An incompatible layout may require a fallback or fail compilation.",
  "一次喂饱矩阵单元": "Feed the matrix units together",
  "首词 ≤ 105 ms，临时内存 ≤ 650 MB": "First token ≤ 105 ms; scratch memory ≤ 650 MB",
  "Prefill 可把多个位置一起算。调节每批位置数：太小要反复派发，太大会占用更多临时内存。": "Prefill can process multiple positions together. Choose the batch size: small batches need repeated dispatch; large batches use more temporary memory.",
  "过去的 K/V 留下来": "Keep the earlier K/V",
  "解码 ≥ 45 token/s，输出必须一致": "Decode ≥ 45 token/s with matching output",
  "每次只生成一个新词。保留旧 K/V，就不必为整段上下文重算投影；查询依然需要读取历史 K/V。": "Generate one word at a time. Keeping earlier K/V avoids projecting the entire context again. Each query still reads the cached history.",
  "把权重装进内存": "Fit the weights in memory",
  "权重与 KV ≤ 24 GB，误差 ≤ 0.30": "Weights and KV ≤ 24 GB; error ≤ 0.30",
  "调节权重精度，实际对教学权重做量化并比较误差。降低位数能减少读权重的带宽与容量，但可能改变词表排名。": "Change weight precision to quantize the miniature weights and compare the error. Fewer bits reduce memory and bandwidth needs, but can change vocabulary rankings.",
  "少落地一次中间结果": "Write one less intermediate",
  "总时间 ≤ 180 ms，交接 ≤ 14 ms": "Total time ≤ 180 ms; handoffs ≤ 14 ms",
  "把连续任务放在合适的芯片上，并融合激活与门控。统一内存也有读写、同步和布局转换成本。": "Place consecutive tasks on suitable chips and fuse activation with gating. Unified memory still has read, write, synchronization and layout-conversion costs.",
  "GPU 与 ANE 一起工作": "Let GPU and ANE work together",
  "首词 ≤ 78 ms，ANE 工作占比 ≥ 20%": "First token ≤ 78 ms; ANE work share ≥ 20%",
  "调整 Prefill 中投影与 FFN 的 ANE 分担比例。过少会闲置 ANE，过多可能让 GPU 等待；同步也花时间。": "Adjust how much prefill projection and FFN work goes to ANE. Too little leaves ANE idle; too much can leave the GPU waiting. Synchronization also takes time.",
  "下一轮不用从头读": "Reuse what the next turn shares",
  "第二轮首词 ≤ 60 ms，内存 ≤ 24 GB": "Second-turn first token ≤ 60 ms; memory ≤ 24 GB",
  "两轮提示共用一段前缀。复用匹配的前缀状态，只计算新增部分；更长上下文会增加 KV 内存。": "Two prompts share a prefix. Reuse matching prefix state and compute only the new part. Longer contexts need more KV memory.",
  "让引擎真的跑得动": "Make the engine work",
