  "<p>教学模拟 · 时间包含派发、同步与数据读写；ANE 工作占比表示分配的计算量，不是硬件计数器。</p>": "<p>Teaching simulation · Time includes dispatch, synchronization and data access. ANE work share is assigned computation, not a hardware counter.</p>",
