  "25 个关卡分为基础搭建、网络计算与引擎调度。先练向量、投影、激活、门控和残差；再构建 Attention 与词表预测；最后处理芯片分工、布局、缓存、量化、内存与速度。这里使用固定手工权重、单头和缩小的向量。": "25 levels cover basic building blocks, network computation and engine scheduling. Start with vectors, projections, activation, gating and residuals; build Attention and vocabulary prediction; then tackle chip placement, layouts, caching, quantization, memory and speed. The examples use fixed hand-written weights, one attention head and small vectors.",
  "序章会验证三个输入位置；正式关卡另外加入两组新输入。每关的线路分别保存，可以随时切换。运行时只在终点比较结果。": "The prologue checks three input positions; later basic levels also test two new vectors. Every level saves its own circuit, and you can switch at any time. Results are compared only at the final output.",
